---
// Single-object vs multi-object writes: an email row plus an unread counter (illustrative).
// Plain inline SVG, site tokens only, polygon arrowheads (no ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const panels = [
  { x: 20, kind: '' },
  { x: 310, kind: 'is-bad' },
  { x: 600, kind: 'is-ok' },
];
---
<figure class="txmo">
  <div class="txmo-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 340" role="img" aria-label="Three panels. One object: a 20 KB document is written whole, so you get all new bytes or all old bytes. Two objects without a transaction: the email row is inserted, then a crash happens before the unread counter is updated, leaving the email present and the badge wrong. Two objects in one transaction: the crash rolls both changes back, so the data stays consistent and a retry is safe.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>When one write is enough, and when it is not</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Khi nào một lệnh ghi là đủ, khi nào không</tspan>
    </text>
    {panels.map((p) => <rect x={p.x} y="44" width="280" height="280" rx="6" class={`txmo-panel ${p.kind}`} />)}

    <text x="36" y="72" class="sec">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One object</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một đối tượng</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="94" width="240" height="56" rx="4" class="txmo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="file" x={66} y={122} size={26} />
    <text x="92" y="118" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>20 KB JSON document</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tài liệu JSON 20 KB</tspan></text>
    <text x="92" y="136" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>one write to one node</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một lệnh ghi trên một node</tspan></text>
    <path d="M160,152 L160,188" class="txmo-arrow" /><polygon points="160,196 156,188 164,188" class="txmo-head" />
    <rect x="40" y="198" width="240" height="56" rx="4" class="txmo-box is-ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="disk" x={66} y={226} size={26} />
    <text x="92" y="222" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>All new bytes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Toàn bộ byte mới</tspan></text>
    <text x="92" y="240" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>or all old bytes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hoặc toàn bộ byte cũ</tspan></text>
    <text x="160" y="284" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Power loss never splices the two.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mất điện cũng không trộn hai bản.</tspan></text>

    <text x="326" y="72" class="sec is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two objects, no transaction</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai đối tượng, không transaction</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="330" y="88" width="240" height="46" rx="4" class="txmo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mail" x={356} y={111} size={26} />
    <text x="382" y="116" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>1. insert the email row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. thêm dòng email</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={550} y={111} size={18} />
    <path d="M450,136 L450,150" class="txmo-arrow" /><polygon points="450,158 446,150 454,150" class="txmo-head" />
    <rect x="330" y="160" width="240" height="46" rx="4" class="txmo-box is-bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="bell" x={356} y={183} size={26} />
    <text x="382" y="188" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>2. update unread_count</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. cập nhật unread_count</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={550} y={183} size={18} />
    <text x="450" y="228" class="note is-bad" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>crash before step 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>crash trước bước 2</tspan></text>
    <rect x="330" y="244" width="240" height="64" rx="4" class="txmo-box is-bad" />
    <text x="450" y="268" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>The email exists,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Email đã có,</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="288" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>the badge still says 0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>huy hiệu vẫn ghi 0</tspan></text>

    <text x="616" y="72" class="sec">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two objects, one transaction</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai đối tượng, một transaction</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="620" y="88" width="240" height="46" rx="4" class="txmo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mail" x={646} y={111} size={26} />
    <text x="672" y="116" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>1. insert the email row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. thêm dòng email</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={840} y={111} size={18} />
    <path d="M740,136 L740,150" class="txmo-arrow" /><polygon points="740,158 736,150 744,150" class="txmo-head" />
    <rect x="620" y="160" width="240" height="46" rx="4" class="txmo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="bell" x={646} y={183} size={26} />
    <text x="672" y="188" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>2. update unread_count</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. cập nhật unread_count</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={840} y={183} size={18} />
    <text x="740" y="228" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>crash: both steps are rolled back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>crash: cả hai bước bị hoàn tác</tspan></text>
    <rect x="620" y="244" width="240" height="64" rx="4" class="txmo-box is-ok" />
    <text x="740" y="268" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Neither change is kept</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không thay đổi nào được giữ</tspan></text>
    <text x="740" y="288" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>so a retry is safe</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nên retry an toàn</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A single document is protected by the storage engine on its own. The trouble starts when one fact lives in two places, such as an email and its unread badge. Wrapping both writes in one transaction means a crash undoes both. The email and counter are an illustrative example.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một tài liệu đơn lẻ được storage engine tự bảo vệ. Rắc rối bắt đầu khi một sự thật nằm ở hai chỗ, như một email và huy hiệu chưa đọc của nó. Gói cả hai lệnh ghi vào một transaction thì crash sẽ hoàn tác cả hai. Email và bộ đếm ở đây chỉ là ví dụ minh hoạ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txmo { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txmo-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txmo svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txmo text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txmo .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmo .sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmo .sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txmo .b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmo .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txmo .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; }
  .txmo .note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txmo .note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txmo .note.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 600; }
  .txmo .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmo-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txmo-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txmo-panel.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txmo-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txmo-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txmo-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txmo-dot { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txmo-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txmo-arrow.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txmo-arrow.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txmo-dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txmo-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txmo-head.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txmo-head.is-ok { fill: var(--gold); }
  .txmo-life { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txmo figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
